id=oppo_battery_health
name=OPPO Battery Health (SOH)
version=v3.2.1
versionCode=321
author=Codex
description=Reads battery health exactly like the ColorOS / O+ Support diagnostic item 030103: the charger HAL is called through app_process (AIDL then HIDL, exactly the official sequence), design capacity from the framework PowerProfile value, same arithmetic, grade and legend. Action button only opens the page; the page does the reading. No result files, no notifications.
